\docType{package}
\title{
Mobius Transport for Directional Data
}

\description{
The Mobius transport is used to generate the Mobius-von Mises-Fisher and Mobius
isotropic scaled von Mises-Fisher distributions. Functions to perform maximum
likelihood estimation, random values generation and other functions are included.
}

